            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Sandra Okamoto"
            },
            "reviewBody": "It was an easy recipe. Instead of shrimp , I substituted with 3T bagoong alamang ( fermented baby shrimp ) and a dash of patis ( 3 Crab Brand). It was delicious. \nThis is my new favorite vegetable dish.",
            "datePublished": "2016-05-26T05:30:02.320Z"
